CORE
contract.sol
--contract HookTarget --solidity-path-coverage --solidity-max-tx 1 --focus-function isHookTarget --path-cov-assert spec.json --goto-functions-only
^--path-cov-assert: unit '.*isHookTarget.*' -- established 0 relation-backed entry assignment\(s\), assumed 1 region bound\(s\) \(0 hole\(s\) punched\) at entry and emitted [1-9][0-9]* candidate assertion\(s\), [1-9][0-9]* of them over the unit's own RETURN VALUE
\A(?!(.|\n)*NOT ONE candidate assertion could be formed)
\A(?!(.|\n)*AGGREGATE)
